{"steam_appid":4935510,"steam_name":"Cellar Keeper","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4935510/1884662801/3a9666ad8da930d4c49c4cec065ba77d91bb010c/1785704528/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1785712412","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257390618/656cde5ec60e2fc570b4714354e5ef7552391a22/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1785712412","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935510/a3d55b89abb4b6f7fe3102db6d84a6ccb31d2ec5/ss_a3d55b89abb4b6f7fe3102db6d84a6ccb31d2ec5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786067985","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935510/29cecec548639e497b128f349f07ca0afca8973b/ss_29cecec548639e497b128f349f07ca0afca8973b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786067985","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935510/801ee2f11f0eb0bec6a1eb3f5ae42390bf9d4786/ss_801ee2f11f0eb0bec6a1eb3f5ae42390bf9d4786.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786067985","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935510/10ad21ab74096c0d52979e0578a4ecc998b84d12/ss_10ad21ab74096c0d52979e0578a4ecc998b84d12.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786067985","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935510/566e5e17aea3a8dcdd67dcbb64b2db05ff150b17/ss_566e5e17aea3a8dcdd67dcbb64b2db05ff150b17.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786067985"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【A Cozy Cellar Organization Simulator】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once-pristine cellar has fallen into complete disarray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return <strong>2,448 bottles</strong> to their proper racks by identifying their <strong>varieties</strong> and restoring perfect order throughout the cellar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935510/extras/eef93e323bb0cb59fc880e87843483b3.poster.avif?t=1786067985\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935510/extras/eef93e323bb0cb59fc880e87843483b3.webm?t=1786067985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935510/extras/eef93e323bb0cb59fc880e87843483b3.mp4?t=1786067985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > 【The Forgotten Keeper】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, the cellar belonged to an eccentric collector who loved his bottle collection more than anything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desperate to preserve it forever, he attempted an ancient spell. The cellar survived... but the spell turned him into a chicken and trapped him inside a small cage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the cellar has fallen into ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore every rack, break the curse, and help the forgotten keeper see the sunlight once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935510/extras/9bac48ca6f49247185904fbe8938d7cf.poster.avif?t=1786067985\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935510/extras/9bac48ca6f49247185904fbe8938d7cf.webm?t=1786067985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935510/extras/9bac48ca6f49247185904fbe8938d7cf.mp4?t=1786067985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Restore Order, One Rack at a Time】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cellar starts in complete chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you organize each rack, the room gradually transforms into a clean, beautiful collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watching disorder disappear is its own reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935510/extras/b5e5f6e348aa60373893cd663b5a2c23.poster.avif?t=1786067985\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935510/extras/b5e5f6e348aa60373893cd663b5a2c23.webm?t=1786067985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935510/extras/b5e5f6e348aa60373893cd663b5a2c23.mp4?t=1786067985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Learn Skills to Organize Faster】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful abilities that improve carrying, searching, and movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your upgrades wisely and discover the most efficient way to organize the cellar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Two Ways to Play】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Cozy</strong> <strong>Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Relaxing gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No time limits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Organize at your own pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Speedrun Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No skill upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pure efficiency</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Compete on the online leaderboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Every second matters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Key Features】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Organize <strong>2,448 bottles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sort bottles by their <strong>varieties</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock <strong>powerful skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Restore a forgotten cellar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Relaxing gameplay with <strong>no time limits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dedicated <strong>Speedrun Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Online Leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Atmospheric underground environment</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 / AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["EgoTrampoline"],"publishers":["EgoTrampoline"],"release_date":"6 Aug, 2026"}